OL,3,AUK-US alliance is closest of any two
OL,4,Anations on Earth, Streeting tells
OL,5,ALabour conference
OL,6,
OL,7,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting tells
OL,8,FLabour's autumn conference that the
OL,9,FUK's "friendship with America is the
OL,10,Fclosest alliance of any two nations on
OL,11,FEarth"
OL,13,FSpeaking about the RAF Fairford
OL,14,Fcounter-terror probe, he says "what we
OL,15,Fsaw yesterday from our security
OL,16,Fservices, our armed forces and our
OL,17,Fpolice was just a small glimpse of the
OL,18,Fextraordinary work they do everyday"
OL,20,FForeign Secretary Ed Miliband is
OL,21,Fspeaking now, with Chancellor John
OL,22,FHealey due to speak later
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
